<li>Kementerian PUPR (2021). “Profil Penerapan Teknologi Konstruksi Bidang Perumahan.” (link not verified here)</li></ol>
<b>Documented:</b> three-part division (sallu / kale / rattiang), stone supports, square posts, bamboo roof covering, peg / notch / mortise-tenon joint families as candidates. <b>Conceptual:</b> all geometry, member positions, joint details, load path. <b>Needed:</b> measured surveys of a named building, joinery drawings, photos of joints, roof-frame section drawings.<br>
